  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Education Thematic Funding Window</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF&apos;S thematic fund for education is a pooled funding mechanism to support UNICEF Strategic Plan 2018-2021 rleated to Goal Area 2 focuses on improving learning
outcomes for children. It has three working areas:
- Equitable access to quality education
- Learning outcomes
- Skills development</narrative>
  </description>
